    "Text and shapes are exported as pixels. Their appearance is preserved, but they are no longer editable text or vector shapes in the PSD.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字和形状会转为像素图层。外观保持不变，但 PSD 中无法再作为文字或矢量形状编辑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text color": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text fields keep standard macOS editing keys. Dialogs share the Apply/Cancel assignments above. Numeric fields use Up/Down, with Shift for larger steps. Standard macOS commands include ⌘Q to quit and ⌃⌘F for full screen. The shortcut editor itself always uses Return to save and Esc to cancel when not recording.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本栏保留标准 macOS 编辑快捷键。对话框共用上方的应用/取消快捷键。数值栏可使用上/下方向键调整，按住 Shift 可增大步长。标准 macOS 命令包括 ⌘Q 退出和 ⌃⌘F 进入全屏。快捷键编辑器在未录制快捷键时始终使用 Return 保存、Esc 取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text · Double-click to edit": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字 · 双击编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text-editing shortcuts need Command, Option, or Control so they do not replace normal typing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
