          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That shape is too large. A shape can cover up to 100 megapixels.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该形状过大。单个形状最多可覆盖 1 亿像素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 2012 response. Calibration reaches most of the strength used by Version 6.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2012 年的处理方式；校准强度接近版本 6。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The brush trails the pointer on a string this long, so a shaky hand still draws a smooth line": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画笔在此长度的绳索上跟随指针移动，使手抖时也能绘制出平滑线条"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The canvas could not be rendered. Try a smaller canvas.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
